    tldr: "Director General of Hadassah Medical Center in Jerusalem since 2021.",
    summary: "Yoram G. Weiss is Director General of Hadassah Medical Center in Jerusalem, having taken over after the resignation of his predecessor in July 2021. An anaesthesiologist and intensive care physician by background, he leads Hadassah's two campuses, which include the Sharett Institute of Oncology and extensive translational research activities.",
