    tldr: "Pathologist and Scientific Director of the Candiolo Cancer Institute (INOC), Piedmont's oncology IRCCS and an OECI-certified Comprehensive Cancer Centre.",
    summary: "Anna Sapino is Scientific Director of the Istituto Nazionale Oncologico Candiolo (Istituto di Candiolo IRCCS), the only oncological IRCCS in Piedmont. She is a professor of anatomic pathology at the University of Turin with a long research record in breast cancer pathology and biomarkers. She oversees the institute's research programmes and its clinical research and innovation division.",
