    tldr: "Medical oncologist who leads Singapore's National University Cancer Institute (NCIS), the country's public cancer centre for adults and children.",
    summary: "Chee Cheng Ean is Executive Director of the National University Cancer Institute, Singapore (NCIS), part of the National University Health System. A senior consultant medical oncologist, she oversees NCIS's clinical services, research and education across its haematology-oncology, radiation oncology and surgical oncology departments.",
