    tldr: "Senior medical oncologist and translational researcher who leads research at NCIS, with a long record in experimental therapeutics and head and neck cancer.",
    summary: "Goh Boon Cher is Deputy Director (Research) at the National University Cancer Institute, Singapore, and a professor at the National University of Singapore. His work centres on early-phase clinical trials, pharmacology of anticancer drugs and head and neck/nasopharyngeal cancers, and he has led many investigator-initiated trials in Asia.",
