    summary: "Jimmy So is Head of the Division of Surgical Oncology and Associate Director (Tumour Groups) at the National University Cancer Institute, Singapore. A professor of surgery at the National University of Singapore, his clinical and research focus is upper gastrointestinal surgery and gastric cancer, including screening and minimally invasive approaches.",
