    summary: "Michael Gnant is President of the Austrian Breast & Colorectal Cancer Study Group (ABCSG) and a professor of surgery at the Medical University of Vienna's Comprehensive Cancer Center. He has led major academic trials in early breast cancer, including studies of adjuvant zoledronic acid and denosumab and the PALLAS trial of adjuvant palbociclib, shaping international treatment standards.",
